    "synthesis_rationale": "We anchor at 0.75 reflecting a plausible but not guaranteed likelihood given a high initial pace and strong baseline risk. The main drivers (early-2026 deaths and high baseline) push probability upward, while data uncertainty and potential weather/operational shifts provide downside risk that justify a calibrated range of 0.60–0.85 rather than a near-certain outcome."
